\u00e4ltetechnik) spielerisch entdecken und erste berufstypische Aufgaben ausprobieren. Ob Technik, Gesundheit oder Handwerk \u2013 finde heraus, was dir am meisten Spa\u00df macht! :)\n\nEarly Access: Sei unter den Ersten, die jobVRiety testen!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "3902217326706597", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_3902217330039930_1240378813803928232_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xu9g_5vFEFkQ7kNvwGOJR32&_nc_oc=AdqrUDCWGs3V-Y2qiItAyiHcPN9puMyAJemyssNscgxpgMI6goym5_D5UhavEeEkkik&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTzwTmzbho_zSr1Ny_LwIdb4uRJXn8Oz8ecl0AF405Tfg&oe=6AFDDA76"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_1080x360.png", "id": "3076099412552471", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825091_3076099415885804_5417180118801740963_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=407zhyZAty0Q7kNvwF9UwLg&_nc_oc=AdrmbOqfttlabUTEVvmcjRY4kRpufMfG1AIyVtcN-esMpJoBK6dFQ7whdeIzG8-9AQE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTAevQOKuLW9Yk4Mniu--8iOffz6CC7wnHPMO7wg-zWrQ&oe=6AFDD676"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateSquare_1440x1440.png", "id": "2448391595528830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824609_2448391598862163_943533169723644988_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=epMHMnBuV-EQ7kNvwHbm6El&_nc_oc=AdoIgeBecEcpPuYQ7_LCztQAxU4RP-Z97q37_QvrXgF5ZxE4e1aT0sAKPEffQOOQrwA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQDzmlYMMQN7viVPVUnRWGopXo9ldy8aAa_lrBxTYC6Yw&oe=6AFDDAFE"}, {"file_name": "JobVR_LogoClaim_rgb.png", "id": "1748084809102207", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "u